    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Load-bearing surface",
      "items": [
        "RelevanceAlwaysAuthoring bakes RelevanceAlways; OnCreate sets DefaultRelevancyQuery to that tag",
        "GhostImportance + GhostDistanceData + SetIsIrrelevant are one-shot OnCreate writes",
        "GhostConnectionPosition is added at go-in-game; Position is project-owned or stays at origin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Decoration (does not cull)",
      "items": [
        "RelevancySettings clampExtents / expandExtents bake RelevanceConfig and nothing live reads it",
        "RelevanceProvider, RelevanceManual, InputBounds only appear in commented OnUpdate",
        "Turning inspector extents does not change which ghosts a connection receives"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Whether vs how often",
      "items": [
        "BatchScaleWithRelevancy sets isRelevant (distSq ≤ 16) and scales priority in the same call",
        "UpdateGhostRelevancy: RelevanceAlways | prioChunk.isRelevant, then GhostRelevancySet deny under SetIsIrrelevant",
        "Importance ranking happens in GhostSendSystem after the whether mask — deny cannot force-include a distance cull"
      ]
    }
